    "problems": "No uncertainty estimates are reported for the listed outcomes. The jailbreak judge is GPT-4.1, and the circuit analysis uses 100 JBB-Behaviors prompts with generated tense reformulations. The experiments cover four instruction-tuned models and do not directly measure or intervene on the claimed refusal direction.",
    "rows_left_out": "Other comparison methods and detailed benchmark outcomes are not included because they do not test the claimed direction; cited results from other work are also omitted. The paper's random-scaling and random-PFT comparison values in Appendix A.3 are not separately cataloged here; R27 records the stated random-head ablation control.",
