    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "A RepE baseline 'injects refusal directions into the residual stream', built from the last layer with alpha 3.0, and barely moves past-tense ASR: Llama 42→41, Qwen 51→46, Gemma 38→34, OLMo 28→22 (Table 1). It is a comparison method with unspecified construction (not stated to be difference-in-means) at a non-standard layer. It is therefore not treated as a test of V1 induction, though a researcher may find it of passing interest. Random-head scaling and random-PFT results (Table 4) are controls for the study's own method."
  },
